<!--
  Marine ECCC CAP fixture. The distinguishing signal is the CLC area geocode
  (layer:EC-MSC-SMC:1.0:CLC) value "004310": marine/water zones carry no
  province prefix and start with "00", whereas land zones are province-numbered
  (e.g. Ottawa = "071100" in eccc_cap_en_update_1.xml).

  Re-verify note: the CLC "00" == marine rule was validated against a
  summer/squall-heavy sample of 552 live CAP files. Confirm it still holds for
  winter gale/storm marine warnings when such data is available.
-->
